{"meta":{"id":"navigation","category":"it/syntax/jsp/navigation","title":"페이지 이동 (forward · redirect · c:redirect) · JSP","subtitle":"(JSP · JSTL · EL)","summary":"RequestDispatcher.forward, jsp:forward, sendRedirect, c:redirect, alert 후 location.href","tags":["jsp","f-navigation"],"color":"orange","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-orange","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-orange-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-orange-50 text-orange-700 border border-orange-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></span>JSP · JSTL · EL</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">페이지 이동 (forward · redirect · c:redirect) · JSP</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-orange-50/70 border border-orange-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> RequestDispatcher.forward, jsp:forward, sendRedirect, c:redirect, alert 후 location.href</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">즉시 이동</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">jsp</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">&lt;%-- 1. forward (서버 내부 이동, request 유지) --%&gt;\r\n&lt;%\r\n  RequestDispatcher dispatcher = request.getRequestDispatcher(&quot;/WEB-INF/views/result.jsp&quot;);\r\n  dispatcher.forward(request, response);\r\n%&gt;\r\n&lt;jsp:forward page=&quot;/WEB-INF/views/result.jsp&quot; /&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;%-- 2. redirect (브라우저 재요청) --%&gt;\r\n&lt;% response.sendRedirect(&quot;주소&quot;); %&gt;\r\n&lt;c:redirect url=&quot;/member/login&quot; /&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;%-- 3. 알림창 후 이동 --%&gt;\r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\n  alert(&#x27;확인 안내 창&#x27;);\r\n  location.href = &#x27;${ctp}/주소/파일명.jsp&#x27;;\r\n&lt;/script&gt;</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> Java › 페이지 이동 (forward vs redirect), Spring › redirect:</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/jsp/navigation/navigation","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"jsp","title":"JSP · JSTL · EL","path":"it/syntax/jsp"},{"id":"navigation","title":"페이지 이동","path":"it/syntax/jsp/navigation"}],"hasImage":false}